    "body": "So, in the Chromium implementation we have a `CanonicalizePartialPath` method here that doesn't seem to have a direct counterpart in the WHATWG URL spec. kenchris/urlpattern-polyfill does a [more direct translation](https://github.com/kenchris/urlpattern-polyfill/blob/main/src/url-utils.ts#L169) of the spec, and I thought it passed the tests, too, though. Let me look at that.",
